.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi John! Let's go for lunch!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: OK, where?", "image": "engenn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you want to go to the coffee shop? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: No, they don't have lunch. There's an Italian restaurant near the movie theater. Want to try it?", "image": "engenn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "6500", "id": 2}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Hmm, where is it?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: It's not far from here. It's at 14 Panamural Street.", "image": "engenn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "16750", "id": 3}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Pannnaam ...<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: 14 Panamural Street. P - A - N - A - M - U - R - A - L.<br />\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: OK, got it.", "image": "engenn2le01ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "25000", "id": 4}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Is that a library over there?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes! I like to get a book and read in the park. There are many parks in the neighborhood.", "image": "engenn2le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "43500", "id": 5}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: And that building ... is that a museum?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: No it isn't a museum. It's an art gallery. We can go there after lunch.", "image": "engenn2le01ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "54500", "id": 6}]}}]}, {"title": "", "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le01ob06re6aud01", "coverimg": "engenn2le01ob06re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Starting Out"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Do You Know the Neighborhood?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people, their likes and dislikes, homes or countries in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking and Saying Where Things Are"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A neighborhood is the area where you live.<br/>To ask where things are in a neighborhood, you ask:<br/>\u201cWhere is the \u2026 ?\u201d<br/>To say where things are, you say:<br/>\u201cThere is a \u2026\u201d for singular words and \u201cThere are \u2026\u201d for plural words. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"3\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where is the ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"library?\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"There is a ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"library\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"near my house.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"There are many ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"parks\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in the neighbourhood.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Definite and Indefinite Articles"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the definite article <span class = \"strong\">the</span> to talk about a <span class = \"italic\">specific</span> noun (person, place or thing).<br/>You can use the indefinite articles <span class = \"strong\">a</span> and <span class = \"strong\">an</span> to talk about something in <span class = \"italic\">general</span>.<br/>You use <span class = \"strong\">a</span> before nouns that start with consonants.<br/>You use <span class = \"strong\">an</span> before nouns that start with vowels (a, e, i, o, u)."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples with A and An\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples with THE\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is that <span class = \\\"strong\\\">a</span> library over there?<br/>No, it's <span class = \\\"strong\\\">an</span> art gallery.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you want to go to <span class = \\\"strong\\\">the</span> coffee shop?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "park"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area with grass and trees, open to the public"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many parks in the neighborhood."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about places in a neighborhood."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "library"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building that has books you can use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to get a book at the library."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coffee shop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to buy coffee and tea"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you want to go to the coffee shop? "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "restaurant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to order food"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  There's an Italian restaurant near the park."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "movie theater"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building where you watch movies"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The movie theater beside my house is new."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "near"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "close to someone or something in distance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The park is near the school."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "far"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a good distance away"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My house is not far from here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "there is"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "focuses attention on something (singular)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a good restaurant down the street."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "there are"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "focuses attention on something (plural)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many parks in the neighborhood."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "over there"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in that place (far from you)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Is that a library over there?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob06aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le01ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of 4-8 places in your neighborhood."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the places. Write 2-3 sentences for each place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Compare your list with your partner. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Add photos or drawings of the places."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write complete sentences when describing places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use adjectives properly. "}]}]}